LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F_Text_H0::
    .string "A GAME BOY ADVANCE is hooked up to\n"
    .string "the TV by a cable.\p"
    .string "A battle is paused on the screen.\n"
    .string "Someone left in a hurry.$"

LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F_Text_H1::
    .string "A field notebook. The cover says:\n"
    .string "PROPERTY OF THE BIRCH FAMILY.\l"
    .string "NOT YOU, DAD.\p"
    .string "Inside: ROUTE 103, sightings by the\n"
    .string "hour, in very neat writing.$"

LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F_Text_PC::
    .string "The PC is full of survey tables,\n"
    .string "all sorted by route.\p"
    .string "One folder is labelled\n"
    .string "BEAT DAD'S RECORDS.$"

LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_2F_Text_WallClock::
    .string "The clock has stopped at six.\p"
    .string "Nobody in this house is ever home\n"
    .string "at six to notice.$"
